# score: WF9 offline fixture — gest= + tape off=/gate/lpf, no aigua/ assets
# summary: 1 bar / 2 voices — self-contained regression cover
# tempo: 120
# time: 4/4
# key: C
# bars: 1
# tuning: A=440
# gestures: v2/sweep-events.json

# This score exists only to keep `gest=` gesture-quotation (the pack-sample
# polyline path — SPEC-AUDIO.md §8) and tape-style `off=`/`gate`/`lpf=`
# sample playback (§4/§7) inside the always-green `cargo test` fast subset
# without depending on `aigua/v2/sweep-events.json` or `aigua/aigua_raw.wav`
# (gitignored, absent from a clean checkout — see
# `mus-rs/crates/mus-cli/tests/parity_expectations.rs`). Every asset it
# references lives next to it in this directory and is committed.

# instruments:
#   gl = gesture voice (treble, sample=bird.wav, root=A3, send=0.20)
#   tp = tape voice (perc, sample=bird.wav, gain=-2, send=0.30)

bar 1: gl=A3q[gest=h0] Rq Rh  tp=Rq Xq[off=200,gate,lpf=1200->2400,pan=-0.3] Rh
